    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are specialized grooming options like hand-stripping available?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients specifically report high-quality hand-stripping for wire-haired dog breeds alongside routine grooming styling."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the facility offer training for fearful rescue dogs?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Clients report substantial progress with specialized obedience and confidence-building classes tailored to timid dogs."
      },
